Time workflow synchronization contract passed: dependency-safe Freigaben navigation without premature rendering, protected admin session restoration, one approvals UI, multi-entry daily aggregation, matching live report semantics, distinct print routes, cross-role invitation session recovery and synchronized snapshots.
Unified worktime center contract passed: one Arbeitszeit navigation, direct audited manager punch, employee-approved historical changes, embedded reports/Nachweise with deterministic refresh and simplified compliance.
backend tenancy source contracts passed
Team News location guard source contracts passed
Team News atomic persistence source contracts passed
Atomic invitation, account, and onboarding source gate passed.
Zero-cost release, Realtime and monitor hardening contract passed.
